'''The MongolZ''' is a [[:Category:Mongolia|Mongolian]] esports organization founded in 2013. They became the first Asian team to reach #1 in both the HLTV World Rankings and the Valve Regional Standings.

They won [[Esports World Cup/2025|Esports World Cup 2025]] and became the first Asian team to reach a [[BLAST/Major/2025/Austin|Major Grand Final]], achieving this with the youngest average player age ever recorded in a Major final.

